{"speciesId":722,"names":{"fr":"Brindibou","es":"Rowlet","en":"Rowlet","ja":"モクロー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ce Pokémon ne baisse jamais sa garde. Pendant la journée, il accumule de l’énergie par photosynthèse, pour mieux agir la nuit venue."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Es cauteloso, desconfiado y de naturaleza nocturna. Durante el día acumula energía mediante la fotosíntesis."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"This wary Pokémon uses photosynthesis to store up energy during the day, while becoming active at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"警戒心が 強い。 昼は 光合成で 力を 溜めて 夜になったら 活動開始。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il s’approche de ses ennemis en glissant dans les airs sans faire le moindre bruit, puis leur assène de puissants coups de patte."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se aproxima a sus enemigos planeando por el aire sin hacer el menor ruido y les propina unas patadas de lo más poderosas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Silently it glides, drawing near its targets. Before they even notice it, it begins to pelt them with vicious kicks."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"一切 音を 立てず 滑空し 敵に 急接近。 気づかぬ間に 強烈な 蹴りを 浴びせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il attaque en tirant des plumes acérées. La force de ses coups de patte est également redoutable."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Usa sus afiladas plumas como arma arrojadiza y la fuerza de sus patas le permite asestar poderosas patadas que es mejor no subestimar."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It sends its feathers, which are as sharp as blades, flying in attack. Its legs are strong, so its kicks are also formidable."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"刃物の ように 鋭い 羽を 飛ばして 攻撃。 足の力も 強く キックも 侮れないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il se sent à l’aise dans les endroits sombres et étroits. Il se sert parfois de la poche ou du sac de son Dresseur comme d’un nid."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se siente a gusto en lugares angostos y oscuros. En más de una ocasión usa el bolsillo o la mochila de su Entrenador a modo de nido."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It feels relaxed in tight, dark places and has been known to use its Trainer’s pocket or bag as a nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"狭くて 暗い場所が 落ち着く。 トレーナーの ふところや バッグを 巣の 代わりに することも あるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"En vol, il attaque en lançant ses plumes aiguisées comme des lames. Au corps à corps, il se bat en donnant de violents coups de patte."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"En pleno vuelo, ataca arrojando sus plumas afiladas como cuchillas y, a corta distancia, castiga al rival propinando poderosas patadas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"At a distance, it launches its sharp feathers while flying about. If the enemy gets too close, Rowlet switches tactics and delivers vicious kicks."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"飛行しながら 切れ味 鋭い 羽根を 飛ばし 近距離では 強烈な キックを 叩きこむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Pendant la journée, il emmagasine de l’énergie par photosynthèse. La nuit, il plane silencieusement à la recherche de proies."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Durante el día acumula energía mediante la fotosíntesis y, al caer la noche, vuela sin hacer ruido en busca de presas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"During the day, it builds up energy via photosynthesis. At night, it flies silently through the sky, on the prowl for prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"昼間は 光合成で 力を 蓄え 夜に なると 羽音を 立てずに 飛んで 獲物を 探す。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Flies noiselessly on delicate wings. It has mastered the art of deftly launching dagger-sharp feathers from those same wings."}],"varieties":[{"id":722,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"gust","learns":[[24,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",29],[18,"level-up",29]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"peck","learns":[[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",9],[25,"level-up",9]]},{"name":"razor-leaf","learns":[[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",14],[20,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"night-shade","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"confuse-ray","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"haze","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swift","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sky-attack","learns":[[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"curse","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"protect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"foresight","learns":[[17,"level-up",18],[18,"level-up",18]]},{"name":"giga-drain","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"endure","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"false-swipe","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"mac